        complexity: { best: 'Rs much smaller than Zi gives almost no loss', avg: 'the loss is a simple divider ratio', worst: 'Rs equal to Zi halves the signal before any gain is applied', note: 'A common collector buffer raises the effective Zi by beta plus one and largely removes the problem.' },
