        code: { lang: 'math', src: 'Capacitance Cf bridging input to output of a stage of gain -Av:\n\nInput side:   CM(in)  = Cf * (1 + |Av|)\nOutput side:  CM(out) = Cf * (1 + 1/|Av|) ~ Cf\n\nHigh-frequency pole:  fH = 1/(2*pi*Rs*C_total_in)\n\nA 4 pF Cbc at a gain of 120 behaves as 484 pF.\n\nCascode defeats this by making the input stage gain ~1.' },
