        code: { lang: 'math', src: 'MOSFET: metal gate over an INSULATING oxide over the channel\n  gate current ~ 0 for EITHER polarity\n\nDepletion type:  channel implanted, conducts at VGS = 0\n  can be depleted (VGS negative) or enhanced (VGS positive)\n\nEnhancement type: no channel at rest, normally OFF\n  conducts only when |VGS| > |VT|, the threshold\n  ID = k*(VGS - VT)^2   in saturation\n\nThe oxide is fragile: observe static precautions.' },
